{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is a short roguelite mining adventure where you play as a dwarf miner, exploring the depths of a mysterious cave. Dig through stones, collect valuable ores, and search for hidden ladders to descend deeper. Keep an eye on your stamina, and make good use of your reliable scanner. Back at camp, catch your breath and spend your ores to upgrade your stats. Each run makes you stronger, letting you venture further into the ever-changing depths of the cave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based destructible terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable stats</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854000?t=1772817727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854000?t=1772817727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854000/e95f76b0f4d1e96c8eb4d94c5395c9788346b2a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772817727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854000/e95f76b0f4d1e96c8eb4d94c5395c9788346b2a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772817727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4084620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is a short roguelite mining adventure where you play as a dwarf miner, exploring the depths of a mysterious cave. Dig through stones, collect valuable ores, and search for hidden ladders to descend deeper. Keep an eye on your stamina, and make good use of your reliable scanner. Back at camp, catch your breath and spend your ores to upgrade you